{"hw":"ἐπῴχατο","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπῴχατο</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπῴχατο</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">3</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">pl.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">plpf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">πᾶσαι γὰρ [πύλαι] ἐπῴχατο</span> all <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">were shut to,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.340</span> </span> (= <span class=\"gk\">ἐπικεκλιμέναι ἦσαν, ἐπέκειντο,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristarch.</span> </span>, who derived it from <span class=\"gk\">ἐποίγω,</span> prob. rightly, cf. <span class=\"gk\">προσοίγνυμι</span>; = ἐπωχλισμέναι ἦσαν <b class=\"lex-tr\">were bolted,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Apollon.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lex.</cite> </span>, reading <span class=\"gk\">ἐπώχατο</span>; <span class=\"gk\">πάσας γὰρ ἐπῴχετο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Zenod.</span> </span>, vulg.).</div></div>"}